self identity true
self tag      self
self named    self
same space    c
to working    c|srgb>linear
from working  c|linear>srgb
empty target  c
empty source  c
missing arg   c
disabled      c
re-enabled    c|a>b
order fast    c [v,f]
order slow    c|srgb>linear [v,f]
order extra   c [v,f,x]
hot fast      1000
hot slow      1000
args guard    10
args slow     16
args one      14
chain x       first
chain mode    second
chain empty   third
chain other   fallthrough
chain none    third
chain moved   second
chain b now   fallthrough
typed string  s
typed undef   none
typed number  other
typed null    other
logic a       A
logic b       b-or-on
logic off     none
logic off b   b-or-on
quiet return  undefined
quiet fall    undefined
half before   original
half arm      armed
half after    installed
escape before one
escape after  replaced
watched yes   yes
watched no    no reads=1
ring a        a
ring b        b
recursive     stop
